prompt:
You are a senior UI/UX designer reviewing a React web app.

App: "Car Details Management System" — a dealership inventory tool. Users log in, browse car cards
(make/model, price in INR, status badge available/sold, owner), add and edit cars in a form with a
live preview, and can ask an AI for a car description. Screenshot 1 is the car list, screenshot 2 the
Add Car form.

All colours come from CSS custom properties in index.css (below). Components use these classes:
header, navbar, card, badge-available, badge-sold, price, specs, action, button, notice, form.

index.css:
*,
*::before,
*::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

:root {
  --bg: #f8fafc;
  --surface: #ffffff;
  --text: #0f172a;
  --muted: #64748b;
  --border: #e2e8f0;
  --brand: #b91c1c;
  --link: #b91c1c;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--text);
  background: var(--bg);
}

a {
  color: var(--link);
}


App.css:
.container {
  max-width: 1000px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 16px;
}

.header {
  background: var(--brand);
  color: #fff;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 40px 16px;
}

.header h1 {
  margin: 0;
}

.header p {
  margin: 4px 0 0;
  opacity: 0.9;
}

.section {
  padding: 24px 0;
}

.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
  gap: 16px;
}

.card {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 16px;
}

.card-head {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 8px;
}

.card h3 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
}

.price {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 8px 0;
}

.specs {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 6px;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.specs li {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 2px 10px;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.badge {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 2px 8px;
}

.badge-available {
  background: #dcfce7;
  color: #166534;
}

.badge-sold {
  background: #e2e8f0;
  color: #475569;
}

.footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 24px 16px;
  color: var(--muted);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.navbar {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 24px;
  padding: 12px 16px;
  background: var(--surface);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
}

.navbar a {
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 500;
  padding-bottom: 2px;
}

.navbar a.active {
  border-bottom: 2px solid currentColor;
}

.stats {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
  gap: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.stat {
  background: var(--surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 16px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.stat-value {
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.stat-label {
  color: var(--muted);
}

.link-button {
  font: inherit;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  background: none;
  border: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  color: var(--link);
  cursor: pointer;
}

.add-car {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 3fr) minmax(0, 2fr);
  gap: 32px;
  align-items: start;
}

.add-car h2 {
  margin-top: 0;
}

@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .add-car {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}

.form {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12px;
}

.form label {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 4px;
  font-weight: 500;
  flex: 1;
}

.form-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
}

.form input,
.form select,
.form textarea {
  font: inherit;
  padding: 8px 10px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: var(--surface);
  color: var(--text);
}

.button {
  font: inherit;
  font-weight: 600;
  padding: 10px 16px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: var(--brand);
  color: #fff;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.button:disabled {
  opacity: 0.5;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}

.notice {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  margin-top: 16px;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.notice-success {
  background: #dcfce7;
  color: #166534;
}

.notice-error {
  background: #fee2e2;
  color: #991b1b;
}

.notice-close {
  font: inherit;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  line-height: 1;
  background: none;
  border: none;
  color: inherit;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.muted {
  color: var(--muted);
}

.spinner-wrap {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 32px 0;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.spinner {
  width: 24px;
  height: 24px;
  border: 3px solid var(--border);
  border-top-color: var(--brand);
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes spin {
  to {
    transform: rotate(360deg);
  }
}

.error {
  margin: 24px 0;
  padding: 16px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: #fee2e2;
  color: #991b1b;
}

.error p {
  margin-top: 0;
}

.search {
  font: inherit;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 360px;
  padding: 8px 10px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: var(--surface);
  color: var(--text);
}

.chips {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.chips > li:not(:has(button)) {
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 2px 12px;
  background: var(--surface);
}

.chip-button {
  font: inherit;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  padding: 4px 12px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--surface);
  color: var(--text);
  cursor: pointer;
}

.chip-button.selected {
  background: var(--brand);
  border-color: var(--brand);
  color: #fff;
}

.models {
  margin-top: 24px;
  padding-top: 8px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.card-actions {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: 12px;
  padding-top: 12px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.action {
  font: inherit;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  padding: 4px 10px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: var(--surface);
  color: var(--text);
  text-decoration: none;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.action:disabled {
  opacity: 0.5;
  cursor: wait;
}

.action-danger {
  color: #b91c1c;
  border-color: #fecaca;
}

.description {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  margin: 8px 0 0;
}

.error ul {
  margin: 0;
  padding-left: 20px;
}

.navbar-user {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-left: 16px;
  padding-left: 16px;
  border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.owner {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  margin: -4px 0 8px;
}

.auth {
  max-width: 420px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.auth .notice {
  margin-top: 0;
}

.label-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}

.ai-button {
  font-weight: 500;
}

.ai-note {
  margin: -4px 0 0;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.ai-note-warn {
  color: #92400e;
}


Give exactly 5 concrete, implementable suggestions to improve visual hierarchy, accessibility
(WCAG 2.1 AA contrast, focus visibility, touch targets) and consistency. Prefer changes that can be
made through CSS custom properties. For each give: a short title, the problem you see (point to the
screenshot or the CSS), the exact change (CSS variables and/or rules), why it helps, and any
accessibility impact. Do not invent features the app does not have.

Respond only with JSON in this shape:
{"suggestions":[{"title":"","problem":"","change":"","css":"","rationale":"","accessibility":""}]}
